0&s=ab5fe6749c9ce87bf90bb58ba889403f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I've been a big fan of your art for awhile now and would love to see my OC in your style :) \n\nMy Vtuber/OC's name is Eniko. She's always playing video games and hanging out with her pet red panda, Poi. Eniko is petite, standing at 4'11\" (149.86cm) tall. He is mischievous, always getting into trouble, and has a childlike mentality. Poi, the red panda, has horns of the same color as Eniko's, and is calm and intelligent.\n\nI am not particular about poses or scenery, so please use whatever comes to mind. I would like to use this piece on my Twitch and social pages, so I will leave a credit wherever it is posted).\n\nThank you for your consideration! (:\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/DqXsfaC", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 883293, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68cedc204ea4d856cc94942e2b5f506c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68cedc204ea4d856cc94942e2b5f506c, https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a69b9c4608784f87b8e4676b602c7543 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cafcb03dd16e595ad5b2a873aeea3e1c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=554f1364be2195bb1069d917449efc67", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=554f1364be2195bb1069d917449efc67, https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=40e1dc8ad3c78a3de0a1defdab2432cc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f98acbd8/uploads/origins/74664e50-3dad-4d90-8559-211d8aad3535?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f4d3bc1d76bb0805b331329fa6b1d4f 3x"}, "body": "Hello I love your art work! I would like to get my VTuber model laying down or sleeping in a field similar to the attached images. If it is too complex to do feel free to take on creative liberty and do something you will enjoy doing! If possible I would like to have the background on a separate layer! \n\nI plan on posting the art on twitter and possibly using it on twitch and youtube! Thank you so much for your time <3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TWRK1L8rzmlVxMQn9PGcl2F5Ryg8ORfo?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 1445283, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a1eaa87/uploads/origins/d9fdc787-6e18-4ea2-b67b-6dc804937b34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc469c58024a02358ad9de1f8fd8c22c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a1eaa87/uploads/origins/d9fdc787-6e18-4ea2-b67b-6dc804937b34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc469c58024a02358ad9de1f8f