p me!\n\nhttps://noripro.jp/talent-mirutani/", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 1083871, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74c657f89a0d06db73a4149a2e611254", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74c657f89a0d06db73a4149a2e611254, https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f8ef9eac87d9157ce7ca779d74dd588 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38fab74d8248f9cd853124a68bb80b43 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff3a1adf1c124279a165b24dc571ddb6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff3a1adf1c124279a165b24dc571ddb6, https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=818ea0ac513da2086851fbda717783e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40fb0016/uploads/origins/3488a3fe-8f27-4800-bbf6-d234ce8b6631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=26654e36eb3b9eb44b21b287f47e4133 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I think your artwork is amazing and really pretty!\nI would love for you to draw my vtubers alternate form/outfit. \n\nI'd like her hair streaks to be pink colored like the \"Shamare\" reference.\nI also included a hairstyle reference, for the style and volume of the hair, so it doesn't look as flat and straight.\n\nI'd also like both of her eyes to be the same shade of pink.\n\nShe is a mischievous ghost with tsundere tendencies, who's also very lazy.\nPose and composition is up to you!\n\nThank you for your consideration and I apologize if my request is a bit confusing.♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=1G1uk5jLLz27Lgipb28y-GIPi2afPAT8Y", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 1062466, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26023d7e95712fa9d9e3bf41e516e416", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26023d7e95712fa9d9e3bf41e516e416, https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0694e55c4f49bbea4ec2c12187e57123 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a3a1b3cd31ca9e088c09cab7c190d53 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c0da01557f9a9c4761606d5303a157e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c0da01557f9a9c4761606d5303a157e, https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f6a8db76fab051ac06c6608e932fdb5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b39d231/uploads/origins/60f8681e-b7be-4b96-b88c-dd0e241f2116?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=482442a54ef286dab6ba4d71fa9df445 3x"}, "body": "Hello, can you please draw my FFXIV character in your style?\n\nShe has horns instead of ears.  Her horns are covered in dark blue dragon scales.  These scales are also found in other places such as her cheeks, neck, arms, thighs, and tail (see reference material).\n\nPlease draw her in her yukata with a shy pose and expression.  A pose and expression similar to this sketch of Noelle would be good:\nhttps://twitter.com/aribababanban/status/1374304845004378116\n\nIt is okay to draw her with or without her mask.  Please choose whatever you think would look best.  Maybe she is holding her mask in her hand instead of a rose?\n\nI will leave the composition and other details up to you.  Thank you!\n\nYukata reference: https://imgur.com/a/xF9GRDw\nHorns and scales reference: https://imgur.com/a/33nLzKq", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 1361986, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b32a5c3f/uploads/origins/53affd44-c8b5-4da5-93bf-48d5fcef1ba4?bg=%23fff&au