 night sky or whatever !\n\nI would like to use it for my schedule, Twitch (no commercial) if you agree with that ! Could the star be in a separate file for maybe animate it later ? And same for the character if I want to put it on another background ?\n\nThank you so much ! \n\nReferences : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lp2lkkXjUnAvFVlAXSolJGDKo2W9mv6b?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 1460035, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ad13867ac50dc0b2b26b6647e9a624", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ad13867ac50dc0b2b26b6647e9a624, https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac303dfbe18416275562ed48cae557d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02b993c56186567fd48568de5ac6350c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=48035f08004faf9e9e188a4d47a66f1c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=48035f08004faf9e9e188a4d47a66f1c, https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4cf76a4492ef0ad0a9a7334805451e71 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a80256f/uploads/origins/cac4e601-de19-4d1e-980d-286e5c5c66b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d138c0bdc91821358de7ea12a74c038c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art and I would like to request my character working in a cute dessert cafe whether it be working behind the counter or serving drinks or desserts. Feel free to choose whatever cafe theme.\n\nThe pose and expression are up to you. She has a pink and white maid outfit with blue details and fluffy brown dog ears and wears rose gold circle glasses. In the back, there's a big pink bow and a dog tail.\n\nThis would be used for SNS / Twitter, schedule art, and Twitch panel art if that is okay with you.\nA version without my name on it would be great as well.\n\nThank you so much.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21zvlmqpqiy7", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@aribababanban/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1104290, "client_id": 618147, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c420968/uploads/origins/4de0a94d-6803-4b27-b796-bd78cd5fda91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3562745d22b7179b1292b1ad58e726b2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c420968/uploads/origins/4de0a94d-6803-4b27-b796-bd78cd5fda91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3562745d22b7179b1292b1ad58e726b2, https://si.imgix.net/6c420968/uploads/origins/4de0a94d-6803-4b27-b796-bd78cd5fda91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0477a25a3838738b81d9e3074e1e0df4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c420968/uploads/origins/4de0